  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Assign the oxidation number to all the elements in the reaction,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mover><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mover><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>0</mn></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>IO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>IO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>Therefore, the value of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3